Absolutely. After the architecture we established, **Phase 5 should be the Location-Based & Verified Attendance layer**: GPS attendance, geofencing, device/location metadata, selfie verification foundation, anti-spoofing controls, and the related admin configuration.

This phase should **extend Phase 4**, not replace its attendance engine.

# PHASE 5 — GPS, GEOFENCING & VERIFIED ATTENDANCE DEVELOPMENT

# AXONTIMEHR — LOCATION-AWARE & VERIFIED ATTENDANCE ENGINE

---

